---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"Makna Lambang — TIDAR"} description={"Makna lambang TIDAR"} bodyClass={"inner-page logo-page"} extraCss={["/pages.css"]}>
<main class="ml-main" id="main"><section aria-labelledby="mlHeroTitle" class="ml-hero">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-shape">
<svg focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 1600 560">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="mlHeroRedGradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#ef101c"></stop>
<stop offset="0.48" stop-color="#e20d19"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#c80712"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<pattern height="22" id="mlHeroDotPattern" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="22">
<circle cx="3" cy="3" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.14" r="1.7"></circle>
</pattern>
</defs>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-red" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroRedGradient)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-dots" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroDotPattern)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-edge" d="M1145 0C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560" fill="none"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-ribbons"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-dots"></div>
<div class="ml-hero-inner">
<div class="ml-hero-copy">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Identitas Visual</p>
<h1 class="ml-hero-title" id="mlHeroTitle"><span>Makna</span><span>Lambang</span></h1>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-rule"></div>
<p class="ml-hero-lead">Membaca nilai kepemimpinan, keberanian, kemakmuran, dan Lima Cinta dalam lambang TIDAR.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ml-garuda-panel">
<img alt="Garuda Pancasila, lambang negara Republik Indonesia" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1042" src="/assets/garuda-pancasila-authentic.webp" width="960"/>
<figcaption class="ml-garuda-caption"><span>Lambang Negara</span><span>Republik Indonesia</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="mlSectionTitle" class="ml-content">
<div class="ml-content-inner">
<div class="ml-logo-column">
<article aria-label="Nilai utama dalam lambang TIDAR" class="ml-logo-card">
<div class="ml-logo-wrap">
<img alt="Lambang resmi TIDAR — Tunas Indonesia Raya" decoding="async" height="702" loading="lazy" src="/assets/logo-tidar-750.png" width="750"/>
</div>
<div class="ml-values">
<div class="ml-value">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-value-icon ml-value-icon--red">
<svg viewbox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="14" r="7"></circle><path d="M10 40v-5.5C10 27.6 15.6 22 22.5 22h3C32.4 22 38 27.6 38 34.5V40"></path><path d="M15 40h18"></path></svg>
</span>
<h3>Kepemimpinan</h3>
<p>Kepemimpinan yang visioner</p>
</div>
<div class="ml-value">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-value-icon ml-value-icon--gold">
<svg viewbox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M8 40h32"></path><path d="M12 40V28h7v12"></path><path d="M23 40V21h7v19"></path><path d="M34 40V14h6v26"></path><path d="m12 20 10-7 7 3 11-10"></path><path d="M34 6h6v6"></path></svg>
</span>
<h3>Kemakmuran</h3>
<p>Mewujudkan kesejahteraan</p>
</div>
<div class="ml-value">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-value-icon ml-value-icon--red">
<svg viewbox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 5 39 10v11c0 10-6.1 17.4-15 22-8.9-4.6-15-12-15-22V10L24 5Z"></path><path d="m24 15 2.3 4.7 5.2.8-3.8 3.7.9 5.2-4.6-2.5-4.6 2.5.9-5.2-3.8-3.7 5.2-.8L24 15Z"></path></svg>
</span>
<h3>Keberanian</h3>
<p>Berani, tegas, dan berintegritas</p>
</div>
<div class="ml-value">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-value-icon ml-value-icon--gold">
<svg viewbox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 41S7 31.2 7 18.5C7 11.6 12.1 7 18 7c3.4 0 5.4 1.5 6 3 1-1.5 3.2-3 6.5-3C36.2 7 41 11.6 41 18.5 41 31.2 24 41 24 41Z"></path></svg>
</span>
<h3>Lima Cinta</h3>
<p>Filosofi dasar TIDAR</p>
</div>
</div>
</article>
</div>
<div class="ml-copy-column">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Identitas Organisasi</p>
<h2 class="ml-section-title" id="mlSectionTitle">Makna setiap<br/>unsur lambang</h2>
<p class="ml-definition">Lambang Tunas Indonesia Raya dilengkapi kata “TIDAR” dan frasa “Tunas Indonesia Raya”. Kata TIDAR ditampilkan berwarna merah, sedangkan frasa Tunas Indonesia Raya berwarna hitam.</p>
<div aria-label="Makna unsur lambang TIDAR" class="ml-meaning-list" role="list">
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">01</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Kepala Garuda</h3><p>Melambangkan kepemimpinan yang visioner.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">02</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Warna Kuning</h3><p>Melambangkan kemakmuran.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">03</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Menghadap Kanan</h3><p>Melambangkan ketegasan dalam bersikap.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">04</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Mata Putih</h3><p>Melambangkan visi yang positif.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">05</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Alur Merah pada Leher</h3><p>Melambangkan sendi-sendi keberanian.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">06</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Kepak Sayap Merah</h3><p>Melambangkan ketegasan dan fondasi yang kokoh.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">07</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Alur Kuning</h3><p>Melambangkan kemakmuran.</p></div></div>
<div class="ml-meaning-item" role="listitem"><span class="ml-number">08</span><div class="ml-meaning-copy"><h3>Lima Kepak Sayap</h3><p>Mewakili filosofi Lima Cinta TIDAR.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
